  "bio": "Matt Salzman is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in traditional styles, based out of Granite City, United States. Renowned for his meticulous attention to detail, Matt prides himself on delivering exceptional and precise tattoos. His clean and professional workspace at Extreme Ink Tattoos ensures a safe and inviting experience for every client seeking to bring their envisioned body art to life.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Granite City, Illinois, United States"
}